    "Le abitudini e lo storico vanno sul tuo iCloud, mai a sbu.dev, e si uniscono a quelli degli altri tuoi dispositivi. Esporta e Importa funzionano come sempre." : {
      "comment" : "Footer of the iCloud switch: where the data goes, and that Export and Import are still there.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your habits and their history go to your iCloud, never to sbu.dev, and merge with those on your other devices. Export and Import work as always."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Abitudine non condivisa" : {
      "comment" : "Alert title: preparing the iCloud share of a habit failed.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Habit not shared"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Per condividere, accedi a iCloud nelle Impostazioni dell'iPhone." : {
      "comment" : "Footer of the Condividi row when iCloud is not available: why it is off and what to do.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To share, sign in to iCloud in your iPhone's Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Per sincronizzare, accedi a iCloud e attiva iCloud Drive nelle Impostazioni dell'iPhone." : {
      "comment" : "Footer of the iCloud switch when iCloud is not available: why it is off and what to do.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To sync, sign in to iCloud and turn on iCloud Drive in your iPhone's Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Persona" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver label of the person symbol in the row of icons for the owner of a shared habit.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Person"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chi la condivide la segna. Tu vedi i progressi e le statistiche." : {
      "comment" : "Info box on the screen of a habit someone else shares with the user.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The person sharing it marks it. You see its progress and statistics."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rimuovi" : {
      "comment" : "Destructive button on the screen of a shared habit: removes it from this iPhone and leaves the share. Infinitive verb.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Remove"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rimuovere “%@”?" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the confirmation before removing a habit someone shares with you from this iPhone: the habit's title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Remove “%@”?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scegli un'emoji per chi la condivide" : {
      "comment" : "Above the row of emoji the user picks from to mark the owner of a shared habit.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choose an emoji for the person sharing it"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sincronizza con iCloud" : {
      "comment" : "Settings switch in Dati: turns on sync with the user's own iCloud, off by default.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sync with iCloud"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Se la rimuovi, sparisce da questo iPhone. Chi la condivide non perde niente." : {
      "comment" : "Under Rimuovi on the screen of a shared habit: what removing it does.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you remove it, it disappears from this iPhone. The person sharing it loses nothing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Su iCloud ci sono dati di una versione più recente di Sbu Habits. Aggiorna l'app per sincronizzare." : {
      "comment" : "Footer of the iCloud switch when the copy on iCloud comes from a newer version of the app.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud has data from a newer version of Sbu Habits. Update the app to sync."
